    "physics_or_process": "Scenic and source-visual modules own none; instanced rehearsal bridge delegates gameplay health,accepted hits and feedback clock to the published shared PracticeTarget parent",
    "loading_arm_visual": "Act1LoadingArmVisual.build(parent:Node3D, origin:Vector3); set_phase(phase:String, progress:float=0); set_parked(bool). Owner instances two children of published CinderLaneMechanism at origin ZERO; progress comes solely from shared state. Inactive+parked internal SourceArtAssembly shifts X\u22124.4 with +X90\u00b0 jib fold. Live assembly ZERO, original poses and source/art-root transforms are unchanged. Four actual scripted graphical routes now instantiate and review current phase/parked geometry; previous failed/staged records are preserved. See portable archive and validation.scripted_graphical_routes. No private clock, cue or collision authority.",
    "rehearsal_target_visual": "Act1RehearsalTargetVisual.build(parent:Node3D); present_state(state:String, hit_fraction:float). Original ground/hit pivot ZERO through published parent/owner bridge. Split feet/rear tie expose the existing cue; only the spent folded mesh group offsets Z\u22120.75. Actual available/spent cues reviewed across four scripted graphical routes; longer-dash slight sleeve/boot trim recorded. No independent health, clock, cue, input or collision.",
    "rehearsal_target_bridge": {
      "path": "scripts/acts/act1/rehearsal_target.gd",
      "class": "Act1RehearsalTarget extends PracticeTarget",
      "instanced_by": "scripts/acts/act1/launch_rehearsal.gd",
      "published_shared_hooks": [
        "PracticeTarget.build_presentation()",
        "PracticeTarget.present_state(visual_state:String,hit_feedback_fraction:float)",
